learnings[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-07T10:43:15.815Z","harness:codex","Nested commands need one semantic operation mapping across parsing, item addressing, universal output, contracts, activation and completion. Completion must consume enriched takes_value metadata rather than infer boolean arity from optional raw schema fields."
  "2026-09-07T11:21:19.637Z","harness:codex",Stage newly created source files before running gates that enumerate git-tracked paths. A working-tree lint pass and a tracked-file static assurance pass can cover different file populations until the new paths enter the index.
